{"authored" [{"question" "q-115105" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{5x+8}{(x+2)^{2}}=\\frac{5}{x+2}+\\frac{B}{(x+2)^{2}},\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $B?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953040/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce6fd9130710f6f82288974366e6ed398a205420c8d0ca28f3d611f8be15c012" "basis" 615 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953040/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-115105" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $(x+2)^{2}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x+8 & =5(x+2)+B.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-2$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(-2)+8 & =5(-2+2)+B \\\\ -2 & =0+B \\\\ B & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953040/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce6fd9130710f6f82288974366e6ed398a205420c8d0ca28f3d611f8be15c012" "basis" 615 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953040/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-115105" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953040/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "66b1124bc06eaefc8dee48c0246afb3d6799036270ec7eb9de3f06955de9e220" "basis" 615 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953040/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-115105" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13953040/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce6fd9130710f6f82288974366e6ed398a205420c8d0ca28f3d6